  "texts": {
    "preamble": "M/S.Aachi Masala Foods Pvt. Limited vs The Food Safety And Standards Authority ... on 21 November, 2024 Author: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan Bench: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan W.P (MD).No Before The Madurai Bench Of Madras High Court Dated: 21.11.2024 Coram The Honourable Mr. Justice G.K.Ilanthiraiyan W.P (MD).No.18603 of 2018 and W.M.P(MD)No.16469 of 2018 M/ s. Aachi Masala Foods Pvt. Limited, Represented by its Authorised Signatory, V.Sukumar, Registered Office at No.1926, 34th Street, 'I' Block, Aishwarya Colony, Anna Nagar West, Chennai-600 040. ...Petitioner Vs. 1.The Food Safety and Standards Authority of India, Represented by its Chief Executive Officer, Sba Bhavan, Kotla Road, New Delhi-110 002. 2.The Commissioner of Food Safety, Tamilnadu Food Safety and Drug Administration Department, 5th Floor, D.M.S.Building, No.259, Anna Salai, Teynampet, Chennai-600 006. 3.The Adjudicating Authority & Additional District Magistrate/ District Revenue Officer, Tiruchirapalli. M/S.Aachi Masala Foods Pvt. Limited vs The Food Safety And Standards Authority ... on 21 November, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/117153488/ 1 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis 1/7 W.P 4.The Designated Officer (Tiruchirapalli), Tamilnadu Food Safety and Drug Administration Department, Tiruchirapalli . 5.The Food Safety Officer, Uppiliapuram Circle, Tiruchirapalli District. ... Responde Prayer: Petition filed under Article 226 of the Constitution o issue a Writ of Certiorari, to call for the records of the third respond No.DRO/DO/12/2018, dated 27.04.2018 of the third respondent and quash th same, so far as petitioner is concerned. For Petitioner : Mr.R.Murali For R1 & R2 : Mr.G.Raja Raman For R3 & R4 : Mr.D.Gandhi Raj Special Government Ple For R5 : Mrs.M.Aasha Government Advocate (C ORDER",
    "facts": "The petitioner is the third accused in the complaint lodged by the first respondent for the contravention of the provision under Section 3(1)(zf)(c) (i) of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 and Regulation 2.2.2(3)(v) of the Food Safety and Standards (Packaging and Labeling) Regulation, 2011. Therefore, it is a contravention of the Regulation 2.2.2(3) of the Food Safety and Standards (Packaging and M/S.Aachi Masala Foods Pvt. Limited vs The Food Safety And Standards Authority ... on 21 November, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/117153488/ 2 Labeling) Regulation, 2011, and the same amounts to misbrand under Section 3(1)(zf)(c)(i). Admittedly, there is no other contravention, except the contravention under the Regulation 2.2.2(3)of the Food Safety and Standards (Packaging and Labeling) Regulation 2011.",
    "arguments": "Admittedly, there is no supplement added by the petitioner and it is a natural drink made up from Mango pulp."
  },
